# mgspgate.msg - arrival on the track outside the gate (mgspgate.ssl). One entry per line.

# 100: first arrival, the gate still shut. 110: any arrival while the town is hostile.
{100}{}{The gate ahead is shut. Beside it a robot swivels toward you with the patience of a thing that has done this ten thousand times.}
{110}{}{A shout goes up on the wall. They remember you here, and not kindly.}
